{"id":"6ba7593680ce3de6","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code.md","title":"The Code of the Book’s Numeral","display":"lem-smullyan-numeral-code — The Code of the Book’s Numeral","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code","aliases":["92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code"],"display":"lem-smullyan-numeral-code — The Code of the Book’s Numeral","source":"第 II 章 p. 23（PDF 40）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-smullyan-numeral-code — The Code of the Book’s Numeral"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 p. 23（PDF 40）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e05c7a445ae4a4cd\" href=\"?note=e05c7a445ae4a4cd\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering\">92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_n^E\">\\(\\nu_n^E\\)</span> 是字符 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{0}\">\\(\\mathtt{0}\\)</span> 后接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个 accent，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_E\">\\(g_E\\)</span> 是十三进制编号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;g_E(\\nu_n^E)=13^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;g_E(\\nu_n^E)=13^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>十三进制位串恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 后接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，所以编码是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"13^n\">\\(13^n\\)</span>。这不同于对象语言数码所指称的自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，也不同于本地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n=S^n(0)\">\\(\\bar n=S^n(0)\\)</span> 的素数幂串码。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 p. 23（PDF 40）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e05c7a445ae4a4cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_n^E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathtt{0}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"g_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;g_E(\\nu_n^E)=13^n.","display":true},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"13^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n=S^n(0)","display":false}],"bytes":1003,"backlinks":[{"id":"6deaff22ee062525","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]] → [[92-df-smullyan-concatenation]] → [[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]] → [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-248","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code]]"}],"outgoing":["e05c7a445ae4a4cd"]}